Office furniture company in Grand Rapids, Michigan.

Makers of the [[Think Chair]].

[[Justin Beitzel]] worked here before [[Common Object Studio]], and [[Fernando Ramirez]] is in Grand Rapids. So the [[Oka Chair]] comes partly out of the contract furniture world it is arguing with.

See [[Herman Miller]], also in Michigan.

Founded in 1912 as the Metal Office Furniture Company.

